commit 4a0b5a5cf0f88ae914ed90ca8a6b5d9f8f396191
Author:     Emily-Kang77 <emilykang135@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Thu Jun 11 17:31:42 2026 -0700
Commit:     Emily-Kang77 <emilykang135@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Thu Jun 11 17:31:42 2026 -0700

    fix: restrict Full Disk Access diagnosis to source-DB permission denials
    
    classify() sees failures from the whole snapshot copy pipeline (staging
    createDirectory, source copyItem, moveItem into place). An unwritable
    temporaryDirectory surfaces EACCES/EPERM too, so the prior chain-walk
    reported fullDiskAccessMissing even when chat.db access was fine.
    
    Attribute the denial by path: diagnose Full Disk Access only when the
    denied path is the source DB or a source sidecar, or when the denial
    carries no path. A denial naming only a staging-destination path is now
    classified as unreadableSource.

